{"id":"wb-6-1014","name":"抗日胜利芷江洽降旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"抗日胜利芷江洽降旧址","text":"抗日胜利芷江洽降旧址位于中国湖南省怀化市芷江侗族自治县芷江镇七里桥村，是1945年8月21日，中日双方芷江洽降的所在地。抗日胜利芷江洽降旧址境内包括芷江受降纪念坊、中国战区总受降旧址、中国人民抗日战争胜利受降纪念馆、萧毅肃陈列室等建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%8A%97%E6%97%A5%E8%83%9C%E5%88%A9%E8%8A%B7%E6%B1%9F%E6%B4%BD%E9%99%8D%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":92293231,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92293231","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d4e8715d054cbf1dce8548ce.jpg","title":"中国战区受降典礼会场复原.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%88%98%E5%8C%BA%E5%8F%97%E9%99%8D%E5%85%B8%E7%A4%BC%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%BA%E5%A4%8D%E5%8E%9F.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9a/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%88%98%E5%8C%BA%E5%8F%97%E9%99%8D%E5%85%B8%E7%A4%BC%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%BA%E5%A4%8D%E5%8E%9F.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​中国战区受降典礼会场复原。","width":320,"height":213}}